    "H3 HYPERFLOW FAST PATH (NVlabs/Sana sol-engine - P10 item 3, 2026-10-24).",
    "Standard H3 ref2va (pruned int8 convrot) + minimax_h3_hyperflow_8step_v1.0 LoRA @1.0 (videorebirth/hyperflow, 2.7 GB, downloading).",
    "8 steps cfg 1 - HyperFlow is an 8-step distillation LoRA (like turbo but HyperFlow family).",
    "5090 benchmark (Sana README): H3 50-step = 989 s -> HyperFlow 8-step BF16 = 193.6 s per 5 s @1344x768 clip w/ audio.",
    "This graph = the part that works on OUR ComfyUI TODAY (no special engine).",
    "The FULL Sol-H3 engine (67.2 s one-stage / 35.5 s two-stage) needs Linux + Py3.12 + CUDA13 + 90 GB RAM -> WSL2 route.",
    "Sol-H3-VAE (fast_h3_vae_noncausal_24l, 6.2 GB, downloading) = optional faster decoder (saves ~10 s/clip).",
    "Repo: E:\\minimax_workflow\\NVlabs-Sana-sol-engine (branch sol-engine). NOT run (D192). D041 ambient-only audio."
   ]
